---
// Timeline comparing a conventional system (frozen on the day it is chosen)
// with TilePark (keeps improving after opening day).
---

<div class="dark tp-panel">
  <div class="tp-fut-axis">
    <span style="left:0%">Decision</span><span style="left:13%">Design &amp; permits</span><span style="left:30%"
      >Construction</span
    ><span style="left:46%">Opening day</span><span style="left:100%;transform:translateX(-100%)"
      >Decades of operation</span
    >
  </div>
  <div class="tp-fut-row">
    <div class="tp-fut-lbl">
      <b>Other automated parking systems</b><span>Frozen at the state of the day they were chosen</span>
    </div>
    <div class="tp-fut-bar old"><i style="left:46%"></i><em>Already outdated at opening, and aging every year</em></div>
  </div>
  <div class="tp-fut-row">
    <div class="tp-fut-lbl"><b>TilePark</b><span>Keeps learning and receives new capabilities</span></div>
    <div class="tp-fut-bar new">
      <i style="left:46%"></i>
      <u style="left:56%">Updates</u><u style="left:68%">New AI features</u><u style="left:82%">New services</u>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
